Swedish lexicon for Libre Tiles
Source: LibreOffice dictionaries sv_SE at commit 75f5dff8c972fff4a32e4ea8434722c277f02a3f
LibreOffice Swedish dictionary pack version 2.40
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-only

The word list is derived by expanding the upstream affix file, preserving the three
Swedish letters that have their own tiles, folding every other marked letter except
u-umlaut, and dropping any form that still contains a letter no Swedish tile bears;
see the lexicon header for why.

